[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    557[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     /// Row 5 — out-of-range enum-like values crossing the FFI boundary. A C
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    558[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     /// `enum` parameter accepts any `int`, so a value with no valid variant is a
